      "content": "It's a profound and understandable feeling to have your life's work suddenly feel obsolete. The shift in technology is a massive wave, and it's natural to feel adrift when your foundation dissolves. Perhaps instead of viewing it as a loss, consider how your deep, nuanced understanding can provide the necessary human context that these models lack. Your experience is a valuable anchor in this rapidly changing tide.",
